Lysander Shakti Memorial Auditorium\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0  was going swimmingly. The sharks were going swimmingly too, in their familiar tank in their familiar sea water. Alexander was fond of bull sharks, though he\'92d been disappointed since childhood that they didn\'92t grow horns. He\'92d done an excellent job of guiding all the hands responsible for transporting them safely and rebuilding their home exactly as if it 
